# VoxBulk VPS (production)

User deploys from a **Linux VPS** (Baota / aaPanel). Treat VPS deploy and git pull issues as first-class when they ask about production.

## Repository on VPS

- **GitHub:** `https://github.com/menasimuk-hub/Vox-new.git` — branch `main`
- **Repo root:** folder containing `deploy-vps.sh`, `vox.sh`, `voxbulk-api/`
- Typical path on server: `/www/voxbulk` or similar (confirm with user if needed)

## Deploy (on VPS — not Windows)

```bash
cd /path/to/Vox
chmod +x deploy-vps.sh vox.sh
./deploy-vps.sh
```

- Prefer **`./deploy-vps.sh`** as the deploy user — **not** `sudo sh ./deploy-vps.sh`
- Script uses `bash`; it calls `sudo` internally for `apt-get` and rsync to wwwroot
- Equivalent: `./vox.sh update`

## Always-on services (systemd)

API A (`:8000`) + API B (`:8001`) use **systemd** (`Restart=always`). nginx `upstream voxbulk_api` load-balances them. Deploy **reloads A then B** — never both at once, never `pkill gunicorn`. Public / admin / dashboard are **static wwwroot**. One-time: `./vox.sh install-service`, `sudo bash scripts/vps-install-dual-api-nginx.sh`, `./deploy-vps.sh`, `sudo bash scripts/vps-install-public-static-nginx.sh`. Celery stays under Supervisor. When adding new VPS daemons, follow `.cursor/rules/vps-systemd-always-on.mdc`.

**Honest limits:** disk / MySQL / Redis / reboot still take the box down. Dual process only covers one API crash or rolling reload.

## Static wwwroot (Baota defaults in deploy-vps.sh)

| App | Build output | wwwroot |
|-----|--------------|---------|
| Admin | `admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/dist/` | `/www/wwwroot/admin.voxbulk.com` |
| Dashboard | `dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/dist/client/` | `/www/wwwroot/dashboard.voxbulk.com` |
| Public site | `voxbulk.com/frontend/dist/client/` | `/www/wwwroot/voxbulk.com` |

## Post–legacy product removal rollout (VPS)

After `git pull origin main` on a server that previously ran the removed isolated food-delivery product:

1. Edit `voxbulk-api/.env` — delete any obsolete isolated-product env keys (no longer read by API)
2. Redeploy: `./deploy-vps.sh`
3. Install Celery beat if missing: `sudo bash scripts/vps-setup-celery.sh` (starts `voxbulk-celery-beat`)
4. Admin → Integrations → Telnyx → **Save** once (clears legacy second-line Telnyx keys from stored JSON if present)
4. Optional ops (not in repo):
   - Disable nginx vhosts for retired restaurant/driver portal domains
   - Delete old runtime voice-note dirs under `data/`
   - Drop the isolated MySQL database when the new product workspace is live
   - Flush stale Redis session keys if reusing WhatsApp numbers for feedback testing

Survey Celery/whisper, interview voice, and platform Telnyx region routing are unchanged.

## API

- FastAPI: `127.0.0.1:8000` (API A) + `127.0.0.1:8001` (API B) via gunicorn systemd units
- Production API host: `https://api.voxbulk.com` (nginx `upstream voxbulk_api`)
- Config: `voxbulk-api/.env` (never commit)
- Recover a 502 without taking both down: `bash scripts/vps-recover-api.sh`

## Git pull blocked by untracked brand/logo files

Common after brand assets were synced manually on VPS then added to git:

```
error: The following untracked working tree files would be overwritten by merge:
 admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/public/brand/*.png
 dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/public/brand/*.png
```

**Fix on VPS (safe — only removes untracked copies):**

```bash
cd /path/to/Vox
rm -f admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/public/brand/icon-black.png \
 admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/public/brand/icon-white.png \
 admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/public/brand/logo-black.png \
 admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/public/brand/logo-white.png \
 dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/public/brand/icon-black.png \
 dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/public/brand/icon-white.png \
 dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/public/brand/logo-black.png \
 dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/public/brand/logo-white.png
git pull origin main
./deploy-vps.sh
```

Newer `deploy-vps.sh` runs `_clear_untracked_pull_conflicts` before pull automatically.

## Git pull blocked by `routeTree.gen.ts`

Dashboard build on the VPS regenerates tracked `routeTree.gen.ts`, so the **next** pull fails with “local changes would be overwritten”.

```bash
cd /www/voxbulk
git checkout -- dashboard.voxbulk.com/dashboard-web/src/routeTree.gen.ts
./deploy-vps.sh
# or once: VOX_HARD_RESET=1 ./deploy-vps.sh
```

`scripts/lib/vps-git-sync.sh` discards dirty `routeTree.gen.ts` before pull automatically (after this fix is on the server).

## OAuth redirect URIs (production)

- Google/Apple/LinkedIn callback: `https://api.voxbulk.com/auth/oauth/{provider}/callback`
- Configure in Admin → Integrations → Social login **and** the provider console

## Public site (static wwwroot)

Production serves `https://voxbulk.com` from `/www/wwwroot/voxbulk.com` (`try_files`). nginx proxies `/frontpage/`, `/robots.txt`, `/sitemap.xml`, and `/news-sitemap.xml` to the API with `Host: api.voxbulk.com`. Rollback to vite preview only with `VOX_INSTALL_PUBLIC_PREVIEW=1` + `VOX_PUBLIC_PREVIEW=1`.

## Skip flags

```bash
VOX_SKIP_GIT=1 ./deploy-vps.sh
VOX_SKIP_BUILD=1 ./deploy-vps.sh
VOX_SKIP_MIGRATE=1 ./deploy-vps.sh
VOX_FORCE_PULL=1 ./deploy-vps.sh   # stash + retry pull (use with care)
```
